  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Jesingbhai Khimabhai Sumad vs State Of Gujarat & on 29 June, 2015 Author: Sonia Gokani Bench: Sonia Gokani R/Cr.Ra/305/2015 Order",
    "facts": "At present he is in jail.",
    "arguments": "1 Mr. D.K.Modi, learned advocate appearing for the applicant-convict has urged that the sample collected was of 'separated milk' and standard applied by the Court are of 'skimmed milk'. No standards according to him are prescribed for 'separated milk'. Therefore, conviction is based on the prescribed standard which are meant for some other commodity. He therefore, urged that the judgment and order impugned is illegal and dehors the provisions of law.",
